3. LICENCE FILES AND DEVICE BINDING
   A MERQO licence file is bound to the device fingerprint recorded at issue.
   Moving the Software to another computer requires a new licence file. Licence
   files are verified offline with an Ed25519 signature; a modified licence file
   is invalid.

4. EVALUATION
   Without a valid licence file the Software runs in a 14-day evaluation mode.
   After that period the Software becomes read-only: existing records remain
   readable and exportable, and backups remain available, but new transactions
   cannot be posted.

